1. Positive, Negative or Zero
Question: Write a program to check whether a number is positive, negative, or zero.
Program:
int n=10;
if(n>0) System.out.println("Positive");
else if(n<0) System.out.println("Negative");
else System.out.println("Zero");



2. Even or Odd
Question: Check if a number is even or odd.
Program:
int n=7;
if(n%2==0) System.out.println("Even");
else System.out.println("Odd");



3. Largest of Two Numbers
Question: Find the larger of two numbers.
Program:
int a=20,b=15;
if(a>b) System.out.println(a);
else System.out.println(b);



4. Largest of Three Numbers
Question: Find the largest among three numbers.
Program:
int a=10,b=30,c=20;
if(a>=b && a>=c) System.out.println(a);
else if(b>=c) System.out.println(b);
else System.out.println(c);



5. Leap Year
Question: Check whether a year is a leap year.
Program:
int year=2024;
if((year%400==0)|| (year%4==0 && year%100!=0))
System.out.println("Leap Year");
else System.out.println("Not Leap Year");





6. Grade Calculator
Question: Print grade based on marks.
Program:
int marks=85;
if(marks>=90) System.out.println("A");
else if(marks>=75) System.out.println("B");
else if(marks>=50) System.out.println("C");
else System.out.println("Fail");





7. Multiplication Table
Question: Print table of 5 using for loop.
Program:
for(int i=1;i<=10;i++)
System.out.println("5 x "+i+" = "+(5*i));





8. Sum of First N Numbers
Question: Find sum from 1 to N.
Program:
int n=5,sum=0;
for(int i=1;i<=n;i++) sum+=i;
System.out.println(sum);




9. Reverse Numbers
Question: Print numbers from 10 to 1.
Program:
for(int i=10;i>=1;i--)
System.out.println(i);




10. Switch Calculator
Question: Perform +,-,*,/ using switch.
Program:
int a=10,b=5;
char op='+';
switch(op){
case '+': System.out.println(a+b); break;
case '-': System.out.println(a-b); break;
case '*': System.out.println(a*b); break;
case '/': System.out.println(a/b); break;
default: System.out.println("Invalid");
}
